silm:instances_papers_20_functorial_transport_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_02_bridge_to_19_mereology_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'BridgeTo19MereologyConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the clinic-side image of the head-observation leg household-side; also, a derived anchor for the transport diagram: the clinic-side image of the household typed leg, carrying composition data.." .
